.claude/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# seed/_build — the live R2 janitors only (cull_orphans.py, shrink_oversized.py).
# The genesis seed pipeline (gatherers, merge, embed, seed/*.json) was retired
# June 2026 — the live /data DB is the only source of truth. See git history.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Oversized-image shrinker: the repoint patch is a transient artifact —
# shrink_oversized.py --apply emits it, apply-image-patch.js consumes it.
seed/_build/shrink_patch.json

